      attribution: "Doris Ulmann, Hideyo Noguchi, 1919, Doris Ulmann Photograph Collection, University of Oregon Libraries, Special Collections and University Archives.",
      attributionUrl: "https://expo.uoregon.edu/spotlight/doris-ulmann/catalog/de39ab1336424ba818fa8206a8e34da6",
